I new to NetBSD (my background is x86 based Linux systems).  I recently
inheirited a couple of Digital Personal Workstation 500au boxes.  I put
the first boot floppy in. I get to the SRM prompt (>>>) and type, as
per the INSTALL instructions:

B DVA0

